# NOTE: package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. Riser is a deployed
# application, not a library - the lockfile is what makes a build reproducible,
# and three.js is pinned exactly because its USD parser behaviour is something
# we test against.

# Generated from package.json and CHANGELOG.md by tools/write-version.mjs.
# Committing them is how the two drifted apart in the first place.
public/version.json
public/CHANGELOG.md
public/docs/

# Vite's dependency pre-bundling cache. Machine-local build output.
.vite/
